    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1253">

                <pb facs="1104" n="790" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg790"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/1361</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Turkey</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Morgenthau</hi>)</head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1915-01-05">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">January 5, 1915</hi>.</date>
                </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>227. Your 191, December 21. From London Embassy, 2d. Grey requests expression of
                    his gratitude conveyed to you.</p>
                <p>Regarding specific demands Minister of Interior, Grey requests you to point out
                    to Talaat Bey that, though railroad line was shelled for obvious military
                    reasons, Alexandretta has not been bombarded. British Admiralty have no
                    intention employing force for any purpose beyond recognized legitimate usages of
                    war. Inform Ottoman Government release of Prince Omar Tousson and other Ottoman
                        <pb facs="1105" n="791" xml:id="pg791"/> subjects mentioned will be accorded
                    under certain reasonable necessary conditions. British Government hope therefore
                    British subjects will be released and permitted to leave the country if they so
                    desire.</p>
                <p>You may communicate the above without comment.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
